e: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.39" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.39" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57ebe06eb5c_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57ebe06eb5c_720.jpg"> </div><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-27/6ab83af150e38native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴埃纳：想战胜我们极其困难，因为我们是攻防一体紧密团结的球队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3fdac0b942a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3fdac0b942a_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3fdac0b942a_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【其他足球动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-27/6ab7f3245fa65native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">预计10-12天恢复！皇马官方：姆巴佩确诊为左膝后关节囊过度伸展</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-27/6ab7f7d0a6d78native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">虚惊一场！阿斯：姆巴佩仅需休战10-12天，不会缺席国家德比</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.48" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260927/202609270048232541.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.48" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.48" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260927/202609270048232541.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260927/202609270048232541.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">皇马官方通报了姆巴佩的伤情检查情况，球员在国际比赛日为法国队出战时受伤。据多家西媒报道，姆巴佩此次受伤预计恢复时间为10-12天。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab7cfc40fd9cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼城主席声明：仍然有信心证明清白，不会给某些人破坏我们的机会</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.45" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609262159579161.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609262159579161_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260926/202609262159579161_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">在昨日曝出曼城114项财务违规成立后，曼城主席卡尔杜恩·阿尔·穆巴拉克今天发布声明，表示俱乐部仍然有信心证明清白。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-27/6ab82cc24c352native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无敌斗牛士！西班牙连续39场不败，继续刷新足坛国家队纪录</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.37" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260927/202609270438562028_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.37" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.37" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260927/202609270438562028_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260927/202609270438562028_1280.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">战胜英格兰后，西班牙各项赛事已连续39场比赛保持不败（仅计算90分钟+加时赛），继续刷新足坛国家队历史最长不败纪录。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-26/6ab7d57f16fa1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">留住老本？BBC：英超联赛内部对剥夺曼城过往冠军并没有太大兴趣</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.29" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260920/6aaff925df684_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.29" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.29" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260920/6aaff925df684.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260920/6aaff925df684.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据BBC消息，英超联赛内部并不太想剥夺曼城过往赛季的冠军。</span></p><p><a hre